<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Légende de la carte OpenHikingMap.">
    <title>Légende OpenHikingMap</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; margin: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; }
        header h1 { color: #00386b; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .legend-section { margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .legend-title { font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block; color: #005691; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px; }
        .legend-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; width: 30%; min-width: 180px; padding: 5px 10px 5px 0; }
        .legend-item img { margin-right: 8px; height: 20px; object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .roads-paths-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px 20px; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .roads-paths-item { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0; }
        hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 30px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header><h1>Légende OpenHikingMap</h1></header>
    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Randonnée & Sentiers (Classification SAC)</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>T1 / T2 / Difficulté inconnue</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="7,5"/></svg>T3 / T4</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1,6"/></svg>T5 / T6</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #666; margin: 10px 0 5px 0; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px dashed #eee; padding-top: 5px;">Sentiers avec faible visibilité au sol :</div>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>T1 / T2 / Inconnue</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="7,5" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>T3 / T4</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1,6" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>T5 / T6</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;"><ul class="legend-list"><li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/via_ferrata.png" alt="Via Ferrata">Via Ferrata</li></ul></div>
    </div>
    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Pistes (pour véhicules)</span>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #666; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-style: italic;">Praticable avec les véhicules suivants :</div>
        <ul class="roads-paths-list">
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 15px;"><line x1="0" y1="10" x2="40" y2="10" stroke="black" stroke-width="4.6" /><line x1="0" y1="10" x2="40" y2="10" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.8" /></svg>Piste goudronnée (tous véhicules)</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 15px;"><line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" /><line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" /></svg>Voitures de tourisme et vélos de ville</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 15px;"><line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" /><line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="6,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" /></svg>Véhicules à garde au sol haute</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 15px;"><line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" /><line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" /></svg>Véhicules tout-terrain (4WD)</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 15px;"><line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-dasharray="5,5" stroke-opacity="0.65" /><line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-dasharray="5,5" stroke-opacity="0.65" /><text x="20" y="14" font-family="Arial" font-size="11" fill="#8B4513" font-weight="bold" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.3" paint-order="stroke" text-anchor="middle">?</text></svg>Inconnu</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Routes Principales</span>
        <ul class="roads-paths-list">
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/autobahn.png" alt="Autoroute">Autoroute, Route nationale</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/landstrasse.png" alt="Route rurale">Route départementale / rurale</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/normalestrasse.png" alt="Rue locale">Route de district, Rue locale</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/strassenimbau.png" alt="Construction">Route en construction</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/service.png" alt="Service">Voie de service</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <hr/><div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Occupation du sol</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/laubwald.png" alt="">Forêt de feuillus</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/nadelwald.png" alt="">Forêt de conifères</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/mischwald.png" alt="">Forêt mixte</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sumpf.png" alt="">Marais</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/moor.png" alt="">Tourbière</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/roehricht.png" alt="">Roselière</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/watt.png" alt="">Estran (vasière)</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sand.png" alt="">Plage, Sable</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/geroell.png" alt="">Éboulis</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gehoelz.png" alt="">Boqueteau</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wiese.png" alt="">Prairie</li>
            <li class="legend-item"></li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wein.png" alt="">Vignoble</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/friedhof.png" alt="">Cimetière</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schrebergarten.png" alt="">Jardins familiaux</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sperrgebiet.png" alt="">Zone restreinte</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergbau.png" alt="">Mine, Carrière</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <hr/><div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Lignes</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/stromleitung.png" alt="">Ligne électrique</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/seilbahn.png" alt="">Téléphérique / Lift</li>
            <li class="legend-item"></li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/boeschung.png" alt="">Talus</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/deich.png" alt="">Digue</li>
            <li class="legend-item"></li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/zaun.png" alt="">Clôture</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/hecke.png" alt="">Haie</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <hr/><div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Symboles</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kirche.png" alt="">Église</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kapelle.png" alt="">Chapelle</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/burg.png" alt="">Château fort</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/burgruine.png" alt="">Ruine de château</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schloss.png" alt="">Château, Manoir</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schlossruine.png" alt="">Ruine de château</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sportplatz.png" alt="">Terrain de sport</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/stadion.png" alt="">Stade</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/turm.png" alt="">Tour</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/aussichtsturm.png" alt="">Tour d'observation</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wasserturm.png" alt="">Château d'eau</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sendeturm.png" alt="">Antenne émettrice</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/mobilfunkmast.png" alt="">Pylône mobile</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/leuchtturm.png" alt="">Phare</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/aussichtspunkt.png" alt="">Point de vue</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/badestelle.png" alt="">Piscine, Baignade</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/camping.png" alt="">Camping</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergwerk.png" alt="">Mine</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergwerk_stillgelegt.png" alt="">Mine désaffectée</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/muehle.png" alt="">Moulin</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/denkmal.png" alt="">Monument, Mémorial</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wegkreuz.png" alt="">Calvaire</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/huegelgrab.png" alt="">Tumulus</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gipfel.png" alt="">Sommet</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gipfelkreuz.png" alt="">Croix de sommet</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/quelle.png" alt="">Source</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/hoehle.png" alt="">Entrée de grotte</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kreuz.png" alt="">Croix</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sattel.png" alt="">Col / Selle</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/laubbaum.png" alt="">Arbre remarquable</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/doline.png" alt="">Doline</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kraftwerk.png" alt="">Centrale électrique</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/photovoltaikanlage.png" alt="">Photovoltaïque</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/windkraftanlage.png" alt="">Éolienne</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schornstein.png" alt="">Cheminée</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
